 "remarks": "Stunning, turn-key townhome in Stamford's highly sought-after Village at River's Edge. This beautifully renovated property offers a bright, open-concept floor plan entirely modernized for effortless living. Upgraded from top to bottom, the home features pristine paint throughout and is completely carpet-free, showcasing gorgeous new wide-plank flooring seamlessly connecting every room and staircase.  The main level is the heart of the home, featuring a spacious living area that flows into a completely refreshed eat-in kitchen. Here, you'll find bright cabinetry, stainless steel appliances, and a brand-new stylish subway tile backsplash. Sliding glass doors open directly to a private, sunny deck,   Upstairs, the generously sized bedrooms are bathed in natural light, highlighted by soaring vaulted ceilings and excellent closet space. Both the full hall bathroom and the main-level powder room have been stunningly remodeled, boasting sleek new vanities, modern fixtures, contemporary mirrors, and crisp linear LED lighting.  Residents of this community enjoy beautifully maintained grounds and resort-style amenities, including a pool, fitness center, and clubhouse. Situated in a commuter, this address offers quick access to local shops, dining, Metro-North, I-95, and the Merritt Parkway. A truly experience awaits!",
